\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
Per essentiam attributa entis sufficienter determinantur, \'a7. 35, 50, hinc posita essentia ponuntur attributa, \'a7. 35. Ergo posito ente ponuntur attributa eius, \'a7. 63, sublato attributo tollitur essentia et ens, \'a7. 35,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 63.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 65.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Modi entis per essentiam non sufficienter determinantur, \'a7. 50, 35, hinc non determinantur, qua exsistentiam, \'a7 55. Ens ergo, qua modos actuales, per essentiam est indeterminatum, \'a7. 34,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 54, i.e.\'a0
\f3\i modi possunt abesse et adesse salva rei essentia.
\f0\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 66.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Exsistentia non repugnat essentiae, sed est realitas, \'a7. 36, cum ea compossibilis, \'a7. 50, 55.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 67.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Cognitio diversitatis est distinctio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.921fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), et ratio distinctionis in distinguendo discrimen (differentia, character, character distinctivus latius dictus, cf. \'a7. 350, nota, nota characteristica){\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.920fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Iam omnis determinatio entis est id, ex quo cognosci potest, ens illud nec indeterminatum, nec alio modo determinatum esse, \'a7. 36,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [19]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a034. Ergo omnis determinatio est discrimen entis, \'a7. 38,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 14.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.921tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) Unterscheidung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.920tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) Unterscheid, Merkmal, Kennezeichen, Unterscheidungs-Zeichen.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 68.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Discrimina entis sunt vel externa seu relativa, vel interna, \'a7. 67, 37, et haec vel essentialia, quae pertinent ad essentiam, vel accidentalia, quae ad exsistentiam, \'a7. 56, vel absoluta, vel respectiva, \'a7. 37.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 69.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Discrimina interna possunt repraesentari in ente in se spectato, \'a7. 68, 37, hinc quomodocumque cognosci, seu dari{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.919fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Data vel possumus etiam (sine compraesentia) sine assumpto alio, sine relatione ad aliud, concipere{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.918fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) et intelligere, i.e. distincte cognoscere, vel non possumus. Illa sunt qualitates{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.917fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), haec quantitates{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.13;brand=default#kant.nach.916fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
