\cf0 Posito ente ponitur essentia, \'a7. 63, ergo complexus essentialium, \'a7. 40, hinc posito ente simul ponuntur essentialia omnia, et ita quidem, ut nullum possit tolli, \'a7. 63, 40. Ergo essentialia entis sunt per se inseparabilia, \'a7. 72,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 15. Unum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.14;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.14;brand=default#kant.nach.907fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) est, cuius determinationes sunt inseparabiles, et transcendentaliter{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.14;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.14;brand=default#kant.nach.906fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) quidem, cu|ius\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [21]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0determinationes sunt per se inseparabiles.\'a0
