Ens mere negativum esset, cui nulla inesset realitas, hinc nec possibilitas, \'a7. 8, nec rationalitas, \'a7. 19, nec actualitas, \'a7. 55, nec unitas, \'a7. 73, nec veritas, \'a7. 89, nec perfectio, \'a7. 94, realitates, \'a7. 36. Ergo ens mere negativum est non ens, et, si videtur ens, est ens fictum, \'a7. 62. Cum ergo omni enti quaedam insit realitas, omne ens est reale, \'a7. 135.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 137.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Omne ens cum sit reale, \'a7. 136, aut nulla ipsi inerit negatio, aut quaedam cum realitatibus eius una inerit, \'a7. 10, et haec quidem aut absolute necessaria, aut in se contingens, \'a7. 102, 104. Prior est negatio stricte dicta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.842fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (ens negativum\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [40]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0stricte dictum). Posterior est privatio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.841fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) seu ens privativum. Essentialia et attributa negativa sunt negationes stricte dictae, \'a7. 106, 107, modi negativi sunt privationes, \'a7. 108.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.842tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) eine Verneinung in engerer Bedeutung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.841tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) eine Beraubung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 138.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Nullae privationes sunt in ente absolute necessariae, \'a7. 137,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 105, hinc internae non sunt essentialia, nec attributa, \'a7. 107. Ergo modi, \'a7. 52. Ens itaque necessarium non habet privationes internas, \'a7. 111, et cui insunt, est ens contingens, \'a7. 111.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 139.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Ens negativum, qua tale, non est positivum, \'a7. 135, at, si consentiret, qua negatio, ad unam realitatem, esset realitas, \'a7. 94, 36, hinc ens negativum, qua tale, non consentit in ente reali, cui inest, \'a7. 137, ad unam realitatem.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 140.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Realitates, qua tales, non consentiunt, nisi ad realitates. Rationatum enim merarum realitatum esse est realitas, \'a7. 36, 14.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 141.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Omne ens est perfectum, \'a7. 99, et reale, \'a7. 137, hinc eius perfectio, qua talis, est consensus realitatum ad unam, \'a7. 94, 140.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
