Positis in ente negationibus ponitur non consensus, \'a7. 141, 139, hinc imperfectio, \'a7. 121, hinc positis in ente negationibus stricte dictis, ponitur imperfectio absolute necessaria, \'a7. 137.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 143.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Imperfectio entis absolute necessaria, aut est attributum eius, aut essentiale, \'a7. 107, 108, at, quia in realitatibus non est ratio sufficiens negationum, \'a7. 139, non est in entis attributis imperfectio, in cuius non sit etiam essentialibus, \'a7. 50, nec est in essentialibus entis imperfectio, in cuius non esset etiam affectionibus,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 \'a7. 23.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 144.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Positis in ente privationibus ponitur imperfectio, \'a7. 142, at in se contingens, \'a7. 138.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 145.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Non est perfectio essentialis sine accidentali, \'a7. 98,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 140, nec accidentalis sine essentiali, \'a7. 98, non est imperfectio essentialis sine accidentali, nec accidentalis sine essentiali, \'a7. 143,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 98, nec sunt perfectio et imperfectio essentialis opposita, \'a7. 81, 142.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 146.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Quo posito ponitur imperfectio, malum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.840fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) est, hinc negationes sunt malum, \'a7. 142,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [42]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0eaeque vel stricte dictae, malum metaphysicum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.839fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), quo posito ponitur imperfectio absolute necessaria, \'a7. 142, vel privationes, malum contingens{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.20;brand=default#kant.nach.838fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) (physicum late dictum, cf. \'a7. 788), quo posito ponitur imperfectio in se contingens, \'a7. 144.\
