\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 148.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Complexus omnium determinationum in ente compossibilium est omnimoda eius determinatio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.835fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Hinc ens aut est omnimode determinatum, aut minus, |\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 \'a7. 10. Illud est singulare{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.834fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) (individuum), hoc universale{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.833fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}). Utrumque respectu omnium minus determinatorum, quae in se\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [43]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0continet, inferius{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.832fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) dicitur, illa respectu huius, superiora{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.831fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}).\
