\cf0 \'a7. 149.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Ens universale spectatum in suo inferiori, et singulare spectatum, qua alia etiam sua praedicata, praeter certum universale, spectatur in concreto{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.830fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) et tunc concretum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.829fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) dicitur. Ens universale quod attenditur quidem, non tamen in inferiori suo, et singulare, in quo tamen certum tantum eius superius attenditur, spectatur in abstracto{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.828fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), et tunc abstractum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.827fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) dicitur. Universale in concreto est universale physicum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.826fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}) (in multis, in re), universale in abstracto est logicum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.21;brand=default#kant.nach.825fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ******}}) (post multa, post rem).\
