\cf0 Mutationes status sunt accidentia, \'a7. 191, hinc non exsistere possunt, nisi in substantiis, \'a7. 194, et quidem posita vi, etiam strictius dicta, \'a7. 197,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 22. Vis illa mutationis, aut in genere inhaerentis accidentis, ratio sufficiens, \'a7. 197, vel est substantiale, quod mutatur, aut in genere, cui accidens inhaeret, vel vis ab eo diversa, \'a7. 10, 38. Si prius est, substantia, cuius status mutatur, vel in genere, cui accidens inhaeret, agit{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;brand=default#kant.nach.771fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}); si posterius est, substantia, cuius status mutatur, vel in genere, cui accidens inhaeret, patitur. Hinc actio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;brand=default#kant.nach.770fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) (actus, operatio) est mutatio status, et in genere actuatio accidentis in substantia, per vim ipsius: passio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.25;brand=default#kant.nach.769fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) mutatio status, et in genere actuatio accidentis in substantia, per vim alienam.\
