\cf0 Pone extra se invicem posita nullo modo totum constituere, seu componi{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.26;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.26;brand=default#kant.nach.744fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), posse: compositum erit intrinsecus impossibile, \'a7. 224, 15. Modus ergo compositionis est internae impossibilitatis oppositum in compositis, \'a7. 81, i.e. interna possibilitas et compositorum essentia, \'a7. 40.\
