\cf0 Scientia signorum est (semiotica, semiologia philosophica, symbolice) characteristica{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.582fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), eaque, I. heuristica{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.581fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), de inveniendis signis tam\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 primitivis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.580fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), quae non habent signa pro partibus, quam derivativis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.579fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}), quae ex signis sunt composita. Horum modus compositionis essentiae signati si sit similior, sunt ea essentialia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.578fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}). Heuristica signorum derivativorum est combinatoria{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.577fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ******}}), et II. hermeneutica{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.576fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *******}}), de cognoscen|dis\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [109]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0signorum signatis. Haec hermeneutica universalis est{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.575fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ********}}). Characteristica prognosticorum est mantica{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.574fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *********}}).\
