\cf0 Signum repraesentationis est terminus (cf. \'a7. 248, symbolum). Termini per vocem humanam usitatiores sunt vocabula{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.573fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Series vocabulorum repraesentationes connexas significantium est oratio (latius dicta){\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.572fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Complexus vocabulorum in certa regione maiori usitatiorum est lingua particularis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.571fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}). Lingua in certa minori regione usitatior, a se ipsa, uti in aliis minoribus regionibus usitatior est, differens idioma est{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.570fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}). Idioma perfectius est dialectus. Termini, ductus oculis observandi, sunt characteres strictius dicti{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.569fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}), cf. \'a7. 67. Hi vel vocabulorum, nominales{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.36;brand=default#kant.nach.568fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ******}}), vel rerum signandarum vocabulis immediati, rea