\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 380.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Progressus (regressus) in infinitum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;brand=default#kant.nach.561fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) esset series entium contingen|tium\cf4 \super \strokec4 [119]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0extra se invicem positorum, quorum unum est alterius causa secundum quid, sine causa simpliciter tali. In quo progressu in infinitum causatum sumitur causa sui, esset ille curvilineus{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;brand=default#kant.nach.560fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) (circularis): in quo causatum non sumitur causa sui, esset ille rectilineus{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.39;brand=default#kant.nach.559fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}).\
