\cf0 Monades clare mundum repraesentantes aut sibi eum distincte, saltim ex parte, repraesentant, aut minus, \'a7. 10. Priores intelligunt, \'a7. 69. Ergo facultatem habent distincte cognoscendi, \'a7. 216, i.e. intellectum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;brand=default#kant.nach.545fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (strictius dictum, cf. \'a7. 519). Substantia intellectualis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;brand=default#kant.nach.544fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), i.e. intellectu praedita, est spiritus{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.40;brand=default#kant.nach.543fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) (intelligentia, persona). Ergo monades huius universi intellectuales sunt spiritus,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 \'a7. 230. Solos in hoc mundo spiritus admittens est idealista.\
