\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 448.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Cum in hoc mundo sit harmonia, \'a7. 356, sit influxus universalis, \'a7. 408, aut erit hic ubique realis, aut ubique idealis, aut aliquando realis, aliquando idealis, \'a7. 212. Harmonia monadum mundi in se mutuo influentium est substantiarum mundanarum commercium{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.525fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Ergo substantiae omnis et huius mundi sunt in universali commercio, \'a7. 357. Sententiae, huic explicando aptae quae videntur, systemata explicandi commercii inter substantias mundi{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.524fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) dicuntur, |\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 eaque si explicando omni omnium commercio adhibeantur, universalia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.523fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), cf. \'a7. 761 (generalia). Mutationes partium mundi in commercio positarum, quarum in una parte commercii evenientium cognosci potest ratio sufficiens ex vi alterius partis commercii, sunt harmoni|cae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.522fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}).\cf4 \super \strokec4 [148]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0Influxus omnium substantiarum mundi in se invicem idealis est harmonia praestabilita universalis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.521fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}), cf. \'a7. 462, eamque ponens in hoc mundo, est harmonista universalis, cuius systema vocatur systema harmoniae praestabilitae universalis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.520fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ******}}).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.525tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) die Verbindung des in einer ganzen Welt vor sich bestehenden.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.524tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) Meinungen von der Art und Weise solcher Verbindung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.523tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) allgemeine.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.522tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) \'fcbereinstimmende Ver\'e4nderungen.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.521tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *****}}) die allgemeine vorherbestimmte \'dcbereinstimmung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.520tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ******}}) die Meinung der allgemeinen vorherbestimmten \'dcbereinstimmung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 449.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systema harmoniae praestabilitae universalis non tollit influxum substantiarum huius mundi in se invicem, sed eum ponit, \'a7. 448, non tollit unam mundi substantiam pati ab altera, \'a7. 448, 212, sed quamlibet tamen mutationem suam, quam ab altera substantia huius mundi patitur, vi sua producere ponit, \'a7. 210, non tollit partium huius mundi conflictum mutuum, \'a7. 213, facultatem receptivitatemque actionum transeuntium, \'a7. 217, multo minus influxum substantiae infinitae, receptivitatemque illius influxus in finitis, \'a7. 448, non solum non tollit agere posse spiritus\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [149]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0in corpora, et corpora in spiritus, sed ponit etiam in hoc mundo corpora et spiritus in se mutuo influere, \'a7. 408, 434, seque posse mutuo contingere, \'a7. 223, 409.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 450.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Influxus realis substantiae mundi partis in aliam mundi partem est physicus. Hinc influxus physicus universalis est universalis substantiarum in mundo harmonia, qua una in alteram realiter influit, eumque ponens in hoc mundo est influxionista universalis. Huius systema est systema influxus physici universalis.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 451.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systema influxus physici universalis non tollit harmoniam substantiarum mundi mutuam eamque universalem, \'a7. 450, 48, sed praestabilitam, \'a7. 448. Non omnis, qui ponit substantias huius mundi in se mutuo influere, inter se confligere, a se invicem pati, et utrumque posse corpora respectu spirituum, spiritus respectu corporum, immo se posse mutuo contingere, est influxionista universalis, \'a7. 449, 450. Influxionista universalis 1) negat ullam substantiam huius mundi, quando patitur ab alia substantia huius mundi, agere et passiones suas vi sua producere, \'a7.\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [150]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0450,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 212, 2) ponit realiter passiones unius substantiae huius mundi produci ab altera substantia huius mundi in eam influente, \'a7. 450. Hinc per systema influxus physici universalis nulla substantia, pars mundi, in ullis suis mutationibus harmonicis agit vi propria, \'a7. 448. Iam vero omnes mutationes substantiae mundanae possunt ex vi cuiuscumque alius monados ad |\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14300 \cf0 \uc0\u8213 \'a0121 \u8213 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
eundem mundum pertinentis sufficientur cognosci, \'a7. 354, 400. Ergo omnes sunt harmonicae, \'a7. 448, et hinc in nullis suis mutationibus ulla substantia mundana agit, ex systemate influxus physici universalis, in omnibus realiter patiens ab aliis substantiis mundanis, quae tamen ob eandem rationem prorsus non agerent, \'a7. 210, hinc nec vires essent, \'a7. 197, q.c., \'a7. 199.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 452.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Qui ponit in omnes substantias huius mundi pati visas ab aliis huius mundi substantiis, et realiter quidem patientes, ex ipsius sententia, solam realiter influere substantiam infinitam, est occasionalista (assistentianus) universalis, eiusque systema est systema causarum occasionalium universale{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.519fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (Cartesianum, s. Malebranchianum potius assistentiae), contradicens \'a7. 400, 408, hinc falsum. Idem patet inde, quod\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [151]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0per occasionalismum nulla mutatio harmonica in substantia ulla mundana est ipsius, sed tantum substantiae infinitae actio, \'a7. 448. Hinc etiam hoc systema omnem in finitis tollit vim et energian, \'a7. 451.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.519tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) die Meinung der allgemeinen sogenannten nur gelegentlichen Ursachen.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 453.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systema causarum occasionalium, nisi harmoniam, influxum tamen mutuum substantiarum huius mundi universalem verum tollit, \'a7. 452, 448, hunc physicum, \'a7. 450, et idealem, \'a7. 212 (nisi sic dicas imaginarium apparentem, \'a7. 12), illam praestabilitam, \'a7. 448. Non omnis, qui ponit substantiam infinitam in omnes finitarum substantiarum passiones realiter influere, nec omnis ille, qui substantiam infinitam solam in eas realiter influere ponit, est occasionalista universalis, sed qui ponit 1) reales esse passiones substantiarum finitarum omnes, 2) a solo influxu substantiae infinitae dependere, \'a7. 452.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 454.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systemata harmoniae praestabilitae et influxus physici universalium in hoc sunt similia, \'a7. 70, ut 1) nec influxum mutuum substantiarum huius mundi, nec harmo|niam,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [152]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0nec influxum substantiae infinitae in easdem realem tollant universales, \'a7. 448, 450, 2) passiones substantiarum huius mundi ponant esse actiones alicuius substantiae finitae; in eo sunt dissimilia, ut posterius excludat ab actione patientem substantiam, prius non excludat, \'a7. 449, 451.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 455.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systema harmoniae praestabilitae et causarum occasionalium universalia in eo sunt similia, ut tollant influxum realem substantiae huius mundi in aliam, eiusdem partem, \'a7. 70, in eo sunt dissimilia, \'a7. 70, ut prius ideales ponat passiones quasdam earum, quas posterius reales ponit, \'a7. 449, 453.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 456.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Systema influxus physici et causarum occasionalium universalia in eo sunt similia, ut passiones unius in hoc mundo substantiae ab altera eiusdem mundi parte utrumque ponat reales; in eo sunt dissimilia, \'a7. 70, ut prius influere solam substantiam infinitam in eas tollat, ponat posterius, \'a7. 451, 452.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 457.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14300 \cf0 \uc0\u8213 \'a0122 \u8213 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
Systemata explicandi substantiarum mundanarum\'a0\cf4 \strokec4 [153]\cf0 \strokec3 \'a0commercium universalia, si singula singularum mundi substantiarum commercia simili modo explicant, simplicia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.518fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) dicuntur. Ergo systema harmoniae praestabilitae, influxus physici et causarum occasionalium universalia sunt systemata simplicia, \'a7. 448, 456. Systemata universalia composita{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.517fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) sunt, quae quaedam quarundam substantiarum mundi commercia diverso modo, quam alia, explicant.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.518tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) die allgemeine Meinungen von der Art und Weise der Verbindung des vor sich bestehenden in einer ganzen Welt sind entweder einfach.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.44;brand=default#kant.nach.517tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) oder zusammengesetzt.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 458.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Praeter harmoniae praestabilitae, influxus physici, et causarum occasionalium systemata universalia, quartum aliquod simplex universale, \'a7. 457, non est possibile, \'a7. 448, 452, infinita seu potius indefinita possunt esse composita, \'a7. 457, 248.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 459.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Per harmoniam praestabilitam, influxum plurium substantiarum mundi in commercio positarum idealem in se invicem maior nexus actuatur, quam per influxum earundem physicum, \'a7. 167. Nam in in|fluxu\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [154]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0physico passio realiter patientis non habet rationem sufficientem in patientis viribus,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 \'a7. 450, 212. In harmonia praestabilita habet passio patientis substantiae rationem sufficientem 1) in ipsius viribus, 2) in idealiter influente substantia, \'a7. 449. Hinc substantia influens in harmonia praestabilita est aeque fecunda, ac in influxu physico, substantia vero patiens est in harmonia praestabilita fecundior, quam in influxu physico, \'a7. 166.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 460.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Per influxum substantiae infinitae soli tributum in substantias in commercio positas realiter patientes, quicquid patiuntur, substantia patiens non est fecundior, quam per influxum physicum, \'a7. 453, altera autem pars commercii finita adhuc minus fecunda, \'a7. 453, 166. Ergo per harmoniam praestabilitam coniunctam cum concursu substantiae infinitae maior nexus actuatur in substantiis in commercio positis, quam per influxum soli infinitae substantiae tributum, \'a7. 167.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 461.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 In mundo perfectissimo est nexus possibilium in mundo maximus, \'a7. 441. Ergo substantiae, quae et quot possunt in eo, connectuntur per harmoniam\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [155]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0praestabilitam coniunctam cum concursu substantiae infinitae, \'a7. 460, 459.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 462.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Si harmonia praestabilita universalis coniuncta cum concursu substantiae infinitae est in mundo perfectissimo possibilis, est ille, qualem harmonista universalis hunc ponit esse, \'a7. 448, 461, nec est, qualemcumque systema quoddam compositum adoptaturus concipiat, \'a7. 451, omnis contra particularis harmonia |\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

