\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0SECTIO IIII.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 SUPERNATURALE.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 474.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Eventus mundi a nullius entis contingentis natura actuatus supernaturalis est. Eventus a determinata certi entis contingentis, in quo evenit, natura non actuatus, respectu illius entis praeternaturalis est. Hinc supernaturalia sunt praeternaturalia respectu naturae universae; et praeternaturalia respectu naturae universae sunt supernaturalia, \'a7. 466. Eventus supernaturalis, qua spectatur ut extraordinarius, est miraculum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.514fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Hinc miraculum est praeternaturale respectu naturae universae. Omne miraculum est supernaturale, sed non omne supernaturale refertur ad miracula.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.514tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) ein Wunder, Wunderwerk.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 475.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Supernaturalia et miracula sunt naturalium, et naturaliter ordinariorum opposita, \'a7. 81, 474. Iam naturalia et naturaliter ordinaria in omni mundo sunt contingentia, \'a7. 354, 257. Ergo supernaturalia et miracula sunt possibilia, \'a7. 101.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \super \strokec4 [163]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0\'a7. 476.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14300 \cf0 \uc0\u8213 \'a0126 \u8213 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
Quae per naturam entis contingentis in mundo actuantur, non sunt supernaturalia, nec miracula, \'a7. 474. Hinc per naturam spiritus, qui pars mundi est, actuata non sunt supernaturalia, non miracula, \'a7. 354, 257.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 477.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Actiones spirituum finitorum in alias mundi partes, per determinatam naturam patientium non actuatae, hinc respectu patientium praeternaturales, \'a7. 474, et extraordinariae, \'a7. 472, 384, non sunt tamen supernaturales, nec miracula, \'a7. 474. Hinc si dicuntur miracula comparativa{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.513fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), miracula comparativa non sunt miracula, quae illis contradistinguenda rigorosa{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/;chunk.id=;toc.id=;brand=default#kant.nach.512fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) vocantur. Si tales actiones supra naturam ponantur, id tantum de certa certi corporis mundive corporei natura concedi potest, \'a7. 470.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.513tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) Vergleichungs-Weise.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.512tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) nach der Strenge sogenannte Wunder.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 478.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Cuius causam naturalem nos non novimus, eventus extraordinarius est prodigium{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.511fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (signum, cf. \'a7. 347,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [164]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0ostentum, portentum). Prodigia sunt vel miracula rigorosa, \'a7. 474, 477, vel naturales eventus, miracula quoad nos{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.510fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.511tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) ein geschehendes Zeichen.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.46;brand=default#kant.nach.510tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) Wunder nach der Fassung des Wahrnehmenden.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 479.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Supernaturalia et miracula cum per universam naturam non actuentur, \'a7. 474, 466, et sint tamen entia contingentia, \'a7. 474, 354, hinc effectus, \'a7. 334, quando exsistunt, habent causam efficientem ens extramundanum, \'a7. 388, de quo testantur, \'a7. 333.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 480.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Contra cursum naturae evenit eventus non naturalis naturalibus succedens, \'a7. 471, 473. Iam supernaturale et miraculum non est eventus naturalis, \'a7. 474, 469. Ergo supernaturale et miraculum fit contra cursum naturae naturalibus succedens, et quidem contra cursum naturae universae, \'a7. 471. Praeternaturale certo corpori, aut certo mundo corporeo, certo spiritui, aut certo mundo pneumatico fit contra cursum naturae aliquem tantum, \'a7. 474, 471. Hinc non omne contra qualemcumque cursum naturae eve|niens\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [165]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0est supernaturale, vel miraculum,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 \'a7. 474.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 481.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Supernaturalia et miracula non sunt absolute extraordinaria, \'a7. 475,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 385, nec contra ordinem mundi omnem, \'a7. 359, 7, nec tamen sunt naturaliter ordinaria, \'a7. 472, 474. Cumque eventus non naturalis naturalibus coexsistens vel succedens evenit contra ordinem naturae, supernaturalia et miracula sunt contra omnem ordinem naturae universae. Ergo non eveniunt secundum normas certi ordinis naturae communes, \'a7. 472. Ergo sunt relative ad ordinem naturae extraordinaria, \'a7. 384. Supernaturalia et miracula sunt extraordinaria respectu ordinis |\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14300 \cf0 \uc0\u8213 \'a0127 \u8213 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
naturae universae, \'a7. 472. Praeternaturale est extraordinarium respectu certi corporis, aut mundi corporei, certi spiritus, aut nexus pneumatici, et ordinis naturae in iisdem determinati, \'a7. 474, 472, ita, ut contra hunc eveniat, \'a7. 384. Ergo non omne extraordinarium respectu qualiscumque ordinis naturae, non omne, quod est contra qualemcumque naturae ordinem, est supernaturale, multo minus miraculum, \'a7. 474.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

