\f3\i\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf4 \strokec4 Sectio I-XVIII (\cf0 \strokec3 \'a7. 504\cf4 \strokec4 -\cf0 \strokec3 699\cf4 \strokec4 ) sind in Bd.\cf0 \strokec3 \'a0XV S. 5\cf4 \strokec4 -\cf0 \strokec3 54\cf4 \strokec4 \'a0abgedruckt.
\f0\i0 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec3 \uc0\u8232 \cf4 \cb2 \super \strokec4 [270]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0SECTIO XVIIII.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 SPONTANEITAS.\
\'a7. 700.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Mutor, \'a7. 505-699, interne, \'a7. 126. Ergo sum ens finitum, \'a7. 254, et contingens, \'a7. 257. Ergo exsistentia mea modus est, \'a7. 134, adeoque status mei omnes sunt in se contingentes, \'a7. 205, 108. Ergo etiam mu|tationes\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [271]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0eorum omnium, \'a7. 124, 125. Ergo omnes actiones meae, omnes passiones sunt |\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 in se contingentes, \'a7. 210. Hinc et omnes actiones meae futurae, \'a7. 298. Hinc nullae actiones meae, nullae passiones sunt absolute vel intrinsecus necessariae, \'a7. 105.\
\'a7. 701.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Necessitatio{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.507fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (coactio) est mutatio alicuius ex contingenti in necessarium, hinc est vel activa{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.506fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) necessitantis, quod non est proprie, nisi substantia, \'a7. 198, vel passiva{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/;chunk.id=;toc.id=;brand=default#kant.nach.505fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) necessitati, quae tribuitur tum accidentibus, vel actioni vel passioni, quae mutantur ex contingentibus in necessaria, tum substantiae, cui eiusmodi necessitata accidentia insunt.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.507tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) die N\'f6thigung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.506tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) die vorgenommene.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.505tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) die gelittene.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 702.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Necessitatio (coactio) absoluta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.504fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) foret, quae in se contingens mutaret in absolute necessarium. Iam nihil potest mutari in absolute necessarium, \'a7. 130. Ergo nec ulla actio, ergo nec ulla mea actio. Ergo absoluta necessitatio ullius actionis meae est impossibilis, \'a7. 7. Omnes actiones meae sunt manentque semper, in ipso actu, et post eum in se contingentes, hinc\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [272]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0et oppositum earum in se possibile, \'a7. 700, 104.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.504tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) an und vor sich nothwendig machen, eine unbedingte N\'f6thigung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 703.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Oppositi multarum actionum mearum admodum magna est possibilitas hypothetica, \'a7. 168. Hinc multarum mearum actionum admodum magna est contingentia, etiam hypothetica, \'a7. 188, 700. Hinc futurae sunt futura admodum contingentia, \'a7. 298.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 704.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Actio a sufficienti principio, quod agenti internum est, dependens est spontanea{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.503fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Unde spontaneitas tribuitur, 1) actioni, quae a principio sufficienti, quod agenti internum est, dependet, 2) substantiae eiusmodi actiones patranti. Iam omnis actio proprie talis a principio, quod agenti internum est, dependet, \'a7. 210, 37. Ergo omnis actio proprie talis est spontanea. Quoniam tamen mutationes ex actionibus passionibusque compositae nonnumquam a potiori denominantur actiones, quatenus passiones sunt, concipiuntur, ut non spontaneae, \'a7. 210.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.503tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) eine selbstth\'e4tige Handlung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \super \strokec4 [273]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0\'a7. 705.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Multae actiones meae, immo omnes proprie dictae, hinc et actiones animae meae sunt spontaneae, adeoque vere tam illis, quam animae meae tribuitur spontaneitas, \'a7. 704. Si automaton dicatur se ipsum mutans, anima erit automaton.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 706.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Spontaneitas minima est, si principium agenti intrinsecum ad unam tantum minimam actionem sufficit, \'a7. 704, 161. Ad quo plures ergo, ad quo |\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14300 \cf0 \uc0\u8213 \'a0132 \u8213 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \cb2 \
maiores actiones principium agenti intrinsecum sufficit, hoc maior est eius spontaneitas, donec sit maxima in eo agente, in quo ad plurimas maximas actiones sufficit. Animae meae admodum magna convenit spontaneitas, \'a7. 705.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 707.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Necessitatio externa{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.502fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (coactio ab extra) est dependens a vi extra substantiam necessitatam exsistente, estque vel idealis, vel realis, \'a7. 701, 212. Actio externe realiter necessitata non esset spontanea, nec proprie actio, \'a7. 704, sed realis passio, \'a7. 210. Necessitatio externa realis est necessitatio (coactio) externa simpliciter talis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.501fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Ergo actiones necessitatione externa simpliciter tali coactae es|sent\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [274]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0passiones reales. Substantia et actiones, quae non absolute necessitantur, sunt liberae (cf. \'a7. 719) a\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 coactione absoluta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.500fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}). Substantia et actiones, quae non necessitantur coactione externa simpliciter tali, sunt liberae a coactione externa simpliciter tali{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.499fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}). Ergo omnes meae mutationes sunt liberae a coactione absoluta, \'a7. 702, omnes actiones meae, omnes actiones animae meae spontaneae, i.e. omnes actiones proprie dictae, \'a7. 704, et anima mea, quatenus sponte agit, sunt liberae a coactione externa simpliciter tali.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.502tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) die \'e4ussre N\'f6thigung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.501tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) die \'e4ussre schlechterdings so genannte N\'f6thigung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.500tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) Kraft und Handlung sind frei von unbedingter N\'f6thigung.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.49;brand=default#kant.nach.499tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) Kraft und Handlung sind frei von \'e4ussrer schlechterdings so genannter N\'f6thigung.\
