\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 708.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Actiones mihi physice possibiles sunt in potestate mea positae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.498fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), realitates mihi physice impossibiles sunt extra potestatem meam positae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.497fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Ergo est actio quaedam vel simpliciter tan|tum,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [275]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0vel etiam secundum quid in potestate mea posita, est quaedam vel simpliciter etiam, vel tantum secundum quid extra meam potestatem, \'a7. 469. Actionum in potestate alicuius agentis positarum oppositum aut est etiam in potestate eiusdem agentis positum, aut extra eandem, \'a7. 9, et utrumque denuo vel simpliciter, vel secundum quid, \'a7. 469. Quae ipsae cum suis oppositis, simpliciter saltim, sunt in potestate alicuius positae, sunt ipsi liberae (cf. \'a7. 719) ratione exsecutionis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.496fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), quarum oppositum simpliciter supra potestatem alicuius positum est, sunt ipsi mere naturales.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 Actio libera ratione exsecutionis, cuius opposito aequalis respectu certi agentis est physica possibilitas, est physice ipsi indifferens{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.495fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) (indifferens, qua exercitium actus).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.498tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) Handlungen stehn.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.497tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) stehn nicht in meiner Gewalt.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.496tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) bei denen Thun und Lassen in meiner Gewalt steht.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.495tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ****}}) gleich leicht und schwer ist.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
