Actiones mere naturales sunt naturaliter necessariae. Unde actiones liberae ratione exsecutionis his contradistinctae physice contingentes sunt, \'a7. 708,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 469.\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [276]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0Hinc futurae nonnumquam futura contingentia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.50;brand=default#kant.nach.494fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) simpliciter vocantur.\
