\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 719.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Facultas appetendi aversandive pro lubitu suo sensitive, est arbitrium sensitivum{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.483fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), facultas volendi nolendive pro lubitu suo est (liberum arbitrium) libertas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.482fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), cf. \'a7. 707, 708, 710 (moralis, simpliciter sic dicta). Libertas pure volendi nolendive est libertas pura{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.481fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}). Ergo substantia arbitrio praedita aut illud sensitivum tantum habebit, aut libertatem tantum puram, aut eandem arbi||trio\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 sensitivo mixtam, \'a7. 718. Actiones, ad quas per libertatem se determinare est in potestate alicuius substantiae positum, liberae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.480fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) sunt, et ipsa substantia, quae et quatenus actiones liberas patrare potest, est libera{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.479fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}).\
