\cf0 Volitiones nolitionesque meae liberae\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [288]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0dicuntur actus animae eliciti, reliquarum facultatum actiones liberae\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 actus imperati, et quatenus a libertate animae pendent, ipsi in eas imperium adscribitur. Hinc animae in semet ipsam{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.468fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) imperium est facultas pro distincto lubitu nunc huius, nunc illius facultatis actiones producendi, nunc earum producendi oppositum. Quo maior ergo libertas, hoc maius liberi in se est imperium, \'a7. 725. Insignis imperii in se ipsum defectus est servitus moralis significatu lato{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.467fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Ad augendum in se imperium faciens est (ingenuum) liberale{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.466fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), servitutem promovens moralem est servile{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/;chunk.id=;toc.id=;brand=default#kant.nach.465fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}).\
