\cf0 Determinata facultatum appetitivarum inter se in certo subiecto proportio est eiusdem indoles{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.462fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), vel erecta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.461fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), habitualiter dominantibus superioribus, vel abiecta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.460fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}), habitualiter dominantibus inferioribus, quarum maxima passio dominans{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.459fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) vocatur. Cumque certa earum proportio ad certum appetibilium aversabiliumve genus facilius feratur, varia hinc temperamentorum animae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.51;brand=default#kant.nach.458fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) genera constituuntur. Ergo temperamentum animae multum mutari potest ac saepius exercitiis et consuetudine, \'a7. 650, 577.\
