\'a7. 740.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Anima humana{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;brand=default#kant.nach.454fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) est anima, quae cum corpore humano in artissimo est commercio. Cumque anima cum corpore, quocum est in artissimo commercio, constituat animal{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;brand=default#kant.nach.453fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}): anima humana cum cor|pore,\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [293]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0quocum est in artissimo commercio, constituit animal, quod hominem{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;brand=default#kant.nach.452fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}) dicimus.\
