Mutato ente finito in infinitum, infinitum oriretur, \'a7. 125, 227, nec aeternum esset, \'a7. 302, quod absolute impossibile, \'a7. 252. Mutatio hominis in ens infinitum est apotheosis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.53;brand=default#kant.nach.447fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), ergo apotheosis est absolute impossibilis.\
\
