\f0\fs21\fsmilli10800 \cf0 \'a7. 776.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 Quamdiu vel unica minima mutatio enti naturalis, vel generatim unicum minimum accidens enti naturaliter inhaeret, durat eius natura, \'a7. 469, 29, et ens vivit, \'a7. 430. Quod si omnes mutationes enti naturales, vel generatim omnia ipsi naturaliter inhaerentia accidentia finiuntur s. cessant, finitur eius natura, \'a7. 469, 23, et ens moritur, \'a7. 430. Ergo vita corporis humani{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.440fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), s. duratio naturae eius, qua pollet, ut corpus humanum, continuatur, superstite vel unico minimo motu vitali vel arbitrario, ipsi, qua corpus humanum est, |\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \u8232 \cb2 naturali, \'a7. 733, 740. Mors corporis humani{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.439fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), s. finis eius naturae, qua pollet, ut corpus humanum, est omnimoda motuum vitalium et arbitrariorum cessatio. Ergo mors definita \'a7. 556 est mors corporis humani.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.440tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) das Leben.\
