\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Animal cum sit compositum ex anima et corpore, cum quo illa est in artissimo\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [315]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0commercio, \'a7. 740, natura eius est composita ex natura corporis et animae in commercio artissimo positorum, \'a7. 430. Hinc quaedam mutationes harmonicae animae corporisque in artissimo commercio positorum dum exsistunt, vivit animal{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.438fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}). Cessatio omnium actionum harmonicarum animae et corporis in artissimo commercio positorum, est mors animalis{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.437fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Iam per mortem corporis cessant omnes harmonicae mutationes animae et corporis morientis in artissimo commercio positorum, \'a7. 776,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 448. Ergo mors corporis est etiam mors animalis, mors corporis humani mors hominis, \'a7. 740. Ergo mors \'a7. 556 definita est mors hominis, \'a7. 776.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.438tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) lebt.\
