\cf0 Mors animalis vel absoluta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.436fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) est, cessatio omnium cum omni corpore animali mutationum animae harmonicarum, vel respectiva{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.56;brand=default#kant.nach.435fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) tantum (transformatio et metamorphosis animalis), cessatio mutationum harmonicarum animae cum aliquo certo tantum corpore, quocum in artissimo fuerat commercio. Mors hominis vel absoluta est, vel respectiva tantum, i.e. moriente corpore, quale in his terris hominibus esse experimur, aut omne\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [316]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0animae humanae cum aliquo corpore cessat commercium artissimum, aut venit cum alio in novum eiusmodi commercium, \'a7. 776, 777.\
