\cf0 Sicut perfectio spiritus finiti 1) vel absolute necessaria est, vel contingens, \'a7. 147, 2) vel naturalis, vel supernaturalis, \'a7. 496, 3) vel interna, vel externa, \'a7. 98, 4) vel moralis late dicta, vel minus, \'a7. 723: ita et bona spiritui, quibus illa positis ponitur, \'a7. 100, sunt 1) vel metaphysica, vel contingentia, \'a7. 147, 2) vel naturalia, vel supernaturalia, \'a7. 469, 3) vel domestica, vel adventicia, \'a7. 660, 4) vel moralia late dicta, vel minus talia, \'a7 723. Moralia la|te\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [322]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0dicta spiritui dato cum eius libertate propius connectuntur, vel ut rationes, \'a7. 14, a priori, \'a7. 24, et ut antecedentia certi eiusdem status, vel ut rationata, \'a7. 14, a posteriori, \'a7. 24, et ut consectaria certi eiusdem status, \'a7. 596, vel utrimque, \'a7. 24. Quae pendent a data libertate propius, stricte moralia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;brand=default#kant.nach.423fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) dicuntur et non numquam simpliciter. Hinc bona spiritui propius ex eius libertate pendentia sunt stricte moralia{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;brand=default#kant.nach.422fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}), et perfectio his positis ponenda beatitudo{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.57;brand=default#kant.nach.421fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 ***}}). |\
