\cf0 Omnis spiritus finitus, sive superior fuerit homine, sive inferior, actualis ha|bet\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [328]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0corpus, quocum est in artissimo commercio, \'a7. 785, 796, vel ad certum extra se centrum constanter gravitans, vel minus. Prior est incola certi corporis in universo totalis, eiusque vel fixi, vel vagi, e.c.\
