Perfectiones dei vel sunt in eodem absolutae, vel respectivae, et in his quaedam relativae, \'a7. 37: aut possunt a nobis repraesentari sine actionis nota, quiescentes{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.61;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.61;brand=default#kant.nach.405fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}), aut non possunt, operativae{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.61;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.61;brand=default#kant.nach.404fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}).\
