\cf0 Bonitas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.63;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.63;brand=default#kant.nach.367fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) (benignitas) est determinatio voluntatis ad faciendum alteri bene. Beneficium{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.63;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.63;brand=default#kant.nach.366fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) est actio alteri utilior ex bonitate profecta. Bonitas minima esset minima voluntatis propensio s. dispositio unius minimi boni in unicum minimum i.e. minime\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [370]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0dignum conferendi, \'a7. 161. Quo ergo magis, quo plura, quo maiora, beneficia, in quo plures, quo digniores, conferre appetit bonitas, hoc maior est, \'a7. 160. Beneficium est maius bonum. \'a7. 336, 187.\
