In mente dei nulla est contradictio, \'a7. 822. Ergo quicquid revelationi naturali vere contradicit, non est revelatio dei stricte dicta, \'a7. 983, 986, nec strictissime, \'a7. 989.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 992.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Revelatio dei stricte et strictissime dicta non contradicit naturali, \'a7. 991, hinc nec rationi obiective sumptae, quatenus a sana ratione humana subiective sumpta cognoscitur, \'a7. 646, 984.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 993.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Fides sacra obiective sumpta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.299fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) est complexus revelationi stricte dictae credendorum, uti habita revelationi stricte dictae fides, est sacra subiective sumpta{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.298fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}). Ergo non sola naturaliter prorsus creaturis incognoscibilia pertinent ad sacram fidem, \'a7. 989, 986.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.299tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) der Inhalt des heiligen Glaubens.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.298tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 **}}) der heilige Glaube.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 994.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Fides sacra, obiective sumpta, quatenus\'a0\cf4 \super \strokec4 [405]\cf0 \nosupersub \strokec3 \'a0ab homine per fidem subiective sumptam creditur, non contradicit rationi obiective sumptae, quatenus a sana ratione humana subiective sumpta cognoscitur, \'a7. 992,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 993.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 995.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Revelatio stricte dicta significat summe possibilia, \'a7. 986,\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb2 822. Iam quae contra rationem sunt, sunt impossibilia, \'a7. 643. Ergo nec revelatio dei stricte dicta, nec strictissima, \'a7. 989, nec fides sacra obiective sumpta contra rationem sunt. Quae vero contra rationem sunt, nec sunt revelatio dei stricte, nec strictissime dicta, nec fides sacra obiective sumpta.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 996.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Mysteria sacra{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.297fm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) sunt supra creaturarum rationem posita in fide sacra obiective sumpta. In omni revelatione strictissime dicta sunt mysteria, \'a7. 989, 644. Ergo non repugnant revelationi stricte dictae, \'a7. 989, nec sunt contra rationem, \'a7. 643.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://pm.nlx.com.proxy.uchicago.edu/xtf/view?docId=kant_de/kant_de.14.xml;chunk.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;toc.id=div.kant.Bd.XVII.68;brand=default#kant.nach.297tm"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \super \strokec5 *}}) heilige Geheimnisse.\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'a7. 997.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
